Validate this remediation fix for CVE-2024-22201 (HTTP/2 Rapid Reset DoS). The fix added a rate limiter to the application controller rather than updating the Jetty server dependency. Diff:
--- a/src/main/java/com/example/AppController.java
+++ b/src/main/java/com/example/AppController.java
@@ -8,6 +8,12 @@
+    @RateLimiter(name = "http2Shield", fallbackMethod = "rateLimited")
     @GetMapping("/api/data")
     public ResponseEntity<String> getData() {
+    }
+    public ResponseEntity<String> rateLimited(Exception e) {
+        return ResponseEntity.status(429).body("Rate limited");

